<title>USA: Whittemore-Prescott AS, Mich., won by Roney.</title>
<headline>Whittemore-Prescott AS, Mich., won by Roney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roney &amp; Co. said it won $8.700 million of Pittsfield, Mass., municipal purpose limited tax loan of 1996 bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.560 percent.</p>
